    "detailed_description": "Backstory:<br>You are having a feverish dream about being stuck in the woods at night and there are zombois coming at you from multiple directions...<strong>WAIT WHAT ?!?</strong>... just when you thought you are about to wake up, you realize, that you <strong>are</strong> actually stuck in the woods at night and there <strong>are</strong> zombois coming at you !?!<br>Luckily you got your semi-auto assault buckshot dispenser at the ready... So better start dispensing!<br><br>Features:<br>- arena style map<br>- zombie survival shooter type game<br>- randomized enemy spawns<br>- dark and moody lighting<br>- semi-auto assault buckshot dispenser<br>- 15 minute timer to beat<br>- new phase every 5 minutes<br><br>Hints:<br>- stay alert<br>- listen carefully for enemy noise (Headphones recommended)<br>- dispense those buckshot pellets in a controlled manner<br>- watch your ammo<br>- if you get caught, you lose",
